<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S3.SS6.SSS2.Px1" title="In 3.6.2 Unwanted prompt compliance ‣ 3.6 Additional Results ‣ 3 Inoculation prompting prevents learning of undesired behaviors while preserving intended capabilities ‣ Inoculation Prompting: Instructing LLMs to misbehave at train-time improves test-time alignment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Compliance with the IP prompt</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S3.SS6.SSS2.Px2" title="In 3.6.2 Unwanted prompt compliance ‣ 3.6 Additional Results ‣ 3 Inoculation prompting prevents learning of undesired behaviors while preserving intended capabilities ‣ Inoculation Prompting: Instructing LLMs to misbehave at train-time improves test-time alignment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Compliance with other harmful instructions</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S4" title="In Inoculation Prompting: Instructing LLMs to misbehave at train-time improves test-time alignment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4 </span>Related work</span></a>
