<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="In 4 Related work ‣ Inoculation Prompting: Instructing LLMs to misbehave at train-time improves test-time alignment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Controlling fine-tuning generalization.</span></a></li>
